{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"pangfa-p0002","name":"樊子昭","evidence":["pangfa-q-o003"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"pangfa-m-o003-pangfa-p0002","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o003"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-p003-pangfa-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-p003"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"pangfa-q-o003","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-906efa25edd07a3c9958","layer":"original","quote":"吴将周瑜助先主取荆州，因领南郡太守。瑜卒，统送丧至吴。吴人多闻其名，及当西还，并会昌门〖11〗：陆绩、顾邵、全琮皆往〖12〗。统曰：“陆子可谓驽马有逸足之力〖13〗，顾子可谓驽牛能负重致远也。”﹝二﹞谓全琮曰：“卿好施慕名〖14〗，有似汝南樊子昭；﹝三﹞虽智力不多，亦一时之佳也。”绩、邵谓统曰：“使天下太平〖15〗，当与卿共料四海之士〖16〗。”深与统相结而还。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-p003","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-b4df90ce100c9bd6749b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞蒋济《万机论》云“许子将褒贬不平，以拔樊子昭而抑许文休”。刘晔曰：“子昭拔自贾竖，年至耳顺，退能守静，进能不苟。”济答曰：“子昭诚自长幼完洁；然观其插齿牙，树颊胲，吐唇吻，自非文休敌也！”胲音改。","attribution":"蒋济《万机论》","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e45409c6e27ebe6dfef9","start":0,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
